      x5  UDP  10.38.22.40 -> 10.38.22.63     :37   [ours] [eth 00:11:22:33:44:01 -> ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff]
      x5  UDP  10.38.22.40 -> 255.255.255.255 :7777 [ours] [eth 00:11:22:33:44:01 -> ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff]
      x5  ICMP t8/c0 10.38.22.40 -> 10.38.22.65     [ours] [eth 00:11:22:33:44:01 -> e0:1a:ea:d4:70:43]
    cap s1-baseline-off-eth4.pcap: 5 frame(s)
